Specifically, the following are derived from `inky` version 2.5.0 and are not
independent discoveries:

  - The JD79668 initialisation and refresh command sequences, and every
    payload constant in them (driver/jd79668).
  - The JD79661 initialisation and refresh command sequences, every payload
    constant in them, and its rotated-and-padded frame layout
    (driver/jd79661).
  - The panel reset timing.
  - The 2-bits-per-pixel framebuffer packing expression.
  - The EEPROM record layout, its colour table and its display-variant table
    (inky/eeprom.go).

The relevant vendor source is reproduced unmodified under `reference/vendor-inky/`
so that a reader can check any constant against its origin. Each derived block
in our source carries a comment naming the vendor file it came from.

Everything else in this library is an independent implementation.
